WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.078
A green test item is a correctness result
for its declared workload.

00:00:04.078 --> 00:00:07.977
To read the performance evidence, open the
PerfChecker test items

00:00:07.977 --> 00:00:11.755
output channel and follow the Evidence
path to its JSON report.

00:00:11.886 --> 00:00:16.169
Inspect the item's validation and each
sample's seconds, bytes, correctness

00:00:16.169 --> 00:00:19.939
and completion status. The Testing view's
elapsed time can include

00:00:19.939 --> 00:00:24.050
worker startup, while the saved sample has
its own measurement boundary.

00:00:24.181 --> 00:00:28.239
Keep that report if you intend to compare
a later change. Native

00:00:28.239 --> 00:00:32.741
test-item JSON and a completed suite
report have separate result paths.

00:00:32.872 --> 00:00:35.452
For distributions, profile stacks or a
version

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:38.480
series, prepare and run the corresponding
suite check.

00:00:38.612 --> 00:00:43.652
This gives you a reproducible first step:
one selected workload, an explicit oracle,

00:00:43.652 --> 00:00:48.212
a completed sample and a saved report
whose units and scope you can inspect.
